        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 164, 1.5 Inch Diameter Thumbprint Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Thumbprint Cabinet Knob has a simple design that will look great in almost any kitchen. The MNG Vanilla Collection Cabinet Pull is available in some of the top trending finish colors of the year. Each Cabinet knob comes packaged with mounting hardware. The 1.5 Inch Diameter Thumbprint Knob can be used on almost any lightweight door or drawer. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"/site/search.cfm?search=MNG+ Vanilla\">MNG Vanilla Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 164 Thumbprint Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
